+.:SP..., .:CA... - return to main view   
+ any key - return to command editor   .m 
 
 
 
+.mainvk.................................                                      
+.'lowercase, also '.' or '/':              .:HE... -> get help                
+  - type a command from scratch      {1}   .mainv.............................
+.'uppercase, digit, and any other:         : .:CA.        .'[a-z./] .'[A-Z0-9]
+    - edit a command from template   {2}   ^  :                 :     :  :    
+    - execute command if predefined  {3}   :  : .hist.........  :     :  :    
+.:CA... - switch to command editor         :  ^    ^  .:NL...   :     :  :    
+                                           :  :    :  .:CA...  {1}    :  :    
+.histk..................................   :  : .:HE...  :      :    {2} :    
+.:NL... - take a command to editor    .m   : .:CA. :     :      :     :  :    
+.:CA... - return to editor untouched       : .cmded..................... :    
+                                           :        ^          .:NL...  {3}   
+.cmdedk.................................   :        :             :      :    
+.:NL... - run a command, sync history .m   :        :    .runcmd..........    
+.:HE... - search in history view           :      .m:             :           
+.:CA... - switch to main view             .:CA.    .exit....................  
+                                           :<----- .:SP...     .:NL...-->!    
+.exitk..................................                                      
+.:NL... - defencive trap for mistakes                                         
+.:SP..., .:CA... - return to main view                                               
+ any key - return to command editor   .m        .m. see 'man vash' for details


+                                      .mainvk.................................
+ .:HE... -> get help                  .'lowercase, also '.' or '/':           
+ .mainv.............................    - type a command from scratch      {1}
+ : .:CA.        .'[a-z./] .'[A-Z0-9]  .'uppercase, digit, and any other:       
+ ^  :                 :     :  :          - edit a command from template   {2} 
+ :  : .hist.........  :     :  :          - execute command if predefined  {3}
+ :  ^    ^  .:NL...   :     :  :      .:CA... - switch to command editor       
+ :  :    :  .:CA...  {1}    :  :                                               
+ :  : .:HE...  :      :    {2} :      .histk..................................
+ : .:CA. :     :      :     :  :      .:NL... - take a command to editor    .m
+ : .cmded..................... :      .:CA... - return to editor untouched   
+ :        ^          .:NL...  {3}          
+ :        :             :      :      .cmdedk................................. 
+ :        :    .runcmd..........      .:NL... - run a command, sync history .m 
+ :      .m:             :             .:HE... - search in history view         
+.:CA.    .exit....................    .:CA... - switch to main view
+ :<----- .:SP...     .:NL...-->!      
+                                      .exitk.................................. 
+                                      .:NL... - defencive trap for mistakes    
+                                      .:SP..., .:CA... - return to main view   
+.m. see 'man vash' for details         any key - return to command editor   .m
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
